      "summary": "JWT Bearer 认证中间件：校验 Authorization 头与 token，加载 tenant 挂到 req.tenant 后放行，校验失败返回 401/403。",
      "tags": ["middleware", "认证", "jwt"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:gateway/src/middleware/auth.ts:getApiKey",
      "type": "function",
